(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-74","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["印厂看守取下灯[[cap|罩]]，请电工测旧板[[capacitance|电容]]，坏[[capacitor|电容器]]早就使机器停转。它不是重新开印的[[catalyst|促进因素]]，真正的底版藏在像[[cave|洞穴]]的旧堆料间。学校原计划[[celebrate|庆祝]]百年，校史照片中的[[cell|电池]]手灯早已坏了。吴老师给我看一张只值几[[cent|分]]的废纸，却有[[century|百年]]纪念编号。捐赠委员会[[chairman|主席]]把旧签清单发给基金后，错过了追回的[[chance|机会]]。纸再便宜也有它曾经到过何处的痕迹，我们让看守指明哪一叠出过库，哪一叠从来没有。","周年目录[[charming|动人]]，实际签收却有[[chasm|裂口]]。教[[chemistry|化学]]的吴老师拿出旧资助[[cheque|支票]]，请我们核到账时间。没人为我们[[cheer|欢呼]]，食堂送来[[cheese|乳酪]]和[[chicken|鸡肉]]，志愿者留一块[[chocolate|巧克力]]给晚回的程雾。去年[[christmas|圣诞节]]，旧[[church|教堂]]借过桌子让老师核旧箱；那桌子上的咖啡[[circle|圆圈]]出现在后来所谓新验收页上。吴老师的[[classmate|同学]]认出笔迹，不能认出实货。文件要求的[[cleanliness|清洁]]核验从未有签名人到场，[[clearly|清楚地]]写着待补。一个词被删之后，基金才把整页换成已完成，这不是看一个人的字好不好看就能解释的差别。","精明的[[clever|聪明的]]排版员没有来，但我们可沿修改痕[[climb|往上追]]。目录用艺术作[[cloak|遮掩]]，将两批货的日期[[closely|紧密地]]拼在一起。墙上[[clown|小丑]]图仍穿着厚[[coat|外套]]，底版纸厚[[coefficient|系数]]标于包装角。看守肯[[collect|收集]]旧版，偏移的蓝[[color|颜色]]说明第二次印刷发生在基金自带机，不是已停工的印厂。老陈不提[[combustion|燃烧]]之类猜想，只说被说成‘烧掉了’的废版实际还在。纸没烧，机器也不能自己转，这就留下必须回答的改印人和时刻。","吴老师不急着给我[[comfort|安慰]]，但给大家一张[[comfortable|舒服的]]椅子。[[common|共同的]]记忆[[commonly|常常]]错在把谁说过的当自己看过的；她现在问最[[commonsense|有常识的]]问题：同样章为什么出现在不同纸上。校史[[communism|共产主义]]教育旧册旁，捐赠单[[comparatively|相对地]]新，版面[[compatibility|兼容性]]却由另一台印机决定。一位与外国研究者同来的[[compatriot|同胞]]只确认捐赠发生，不确认后续核验。吴老师于是把他的落款留在原页，不再让同一段文字跨越半年替另一辆车说话。我们将核对说明贴到照片旁，免得后来翻档的人又看见一份孤立的签名。","叶澄终于带来[[complete|完整的]]验收页，手在袋口停了很久。程雾说不必等到能[[completely|完全地]]解释自己才交纸。事情的[[complexity|复杂性]]不会因她躲着就少一层，改印却会继续[[complicate|使复杂]]后面的交接。我要[[comprehend|理解]]的是她当时实际知道什么。页角有[[compression|压紧]]留下的夹痕，中栏则是她亲手写的‘待清洗复核’，后来复写层的‘待’字被挡掉。叶澄承认，她发觉后没有及时追查，因为怕提前验收的自己先被追究。程雾让她说慢些，不用再挑让自己显得最体面的顺序。","他把签过的原页交何警官指定的接收人员，另留工作影像。那页不能洗去提前验收，但使我们找到错改从哪一笔开始。吴老师收回可归校的旧目录，看着自己的名字说以后会多等一辆车到场再签。老陈说等不是不做事，有时是把该做的事做完。支线接货员打来电话，同号主箱并未入校库，而是又去了一座铁路补给中转棚，出库原因写着印刷教材换站。我们离开印厂时路灯亮了，程雾把那块巧克力一分为三。下一章要将验收页与实际接货人的时间并上，不能让一个被抹掉的‘待’再把货送得更远。"],"en":["Removing a lamp [[cap|cap]], the guard asked an electrician to check [[capacitance|capacitance]]: a failed [[capacitor|capacitor]] had stopped printing. It was no new production [[catalyst|catalyst]]. Plates lay in a [[cave|cave]]-like store. School plans to [[celebrate|celebrate]] a centenary used photographs of a broken [[cell|cell]] lamp. Paper worth a few [[cent|cents]] carried [[century|century]] numbers. The committee [[chairman|chairman]] sent signed lists away, missing the [[chance|chance]] to retrieve them. Even cheap paper retained journeys; the guard distinguished stacks that left from those always stored.","A [[charming|charming]] catalogue concealed a receipt [[chasm|chasm]]. Wu, a [[chemistry|chemistry]] teacher, supplied an old aid [[cheque|cheque]] to check its payment date. No [[cheer|cheer]] accompanied food: [[cheese|cheese]], [[chicken|chicken]] and [[chocolate|chocolate]] saved for Cheng. Last [[christmas|Christmas]], a [[church|church]] lent a table whose coffee [[circle|circle]] appeared on supposed new acceptance. Wu's [[classmate|classmate]] recognized writing, not cargo. A [[cleanliness|cleanliness]] check had [[clearly|clearly]] remained pending with no signer attending. Deleting that condition allowed a completed form. The difference required more than admiring or recognizing somebody's handwriting.","A [[clever|clever]] typesetter was absent, but edits let us [[climb|climb]] backward. Art became a [[cloak|cloak]] for dates placed [[closely|closely]] together. A [[clown|clown]] wore a [[coat|coat]] above a packaging [[coefficient|coefficient]] for paper thickness. The guard helped [[collect|collect]] plates. Misaligned blue [[color|color]] indicated printing by a fund-supplied machine, not this stopped shop. Chen offered no [[combustion|combustion]] speculation: supposedly burned waste survived. Paper had not burned; machinery could not operate itself. An editor and actual time therefore remained answerable questions.","Wu offered no easy [[comfort|comfort]], only a [[comfortable|comfortable]] chair. [[common|Common]] memories [[commonly|commonly]] confused heard and witnessed facts. Her [[commonsense|commonsense]] question concerned stamps on different paper. Beside old [[communism|communism]] teaching material the donation sheet was [[comparatively|comparatively]] new; format [[compatibility|compatibility]] depended on another machine. A researcher's [[compatriot|compatriot]] confirmed donation alone. She kept his signature in its proper context instead of sending words across six months to testify for another vehicle. We attached comparison notes to photographs so future readers would not encounter merely an isolated name.","Ye brought the [[complete|complete]] page, hesitating at its bag. Cheng said she need not [[completely|completely]] explain himself first. [[complexity|Complexity]] would persist; concealment would [[complicate|complicate]] later transfers. I sought to [[comprehend|comprehend]] what she had known. A [[compression|compression]] mark held the edge. Her handwritten 'await cleaning review' had lost 'await' beneath a copied layer. She admitted discovering the deletion and not following it up, fearing liability for early acceptance. Cheng let her speak slowly rather than choose the most flattering order.","Ye handed the original to He's designated recipient, keeping authorized images. It did not erase early acceptance, but located the alteration. Wu recovered school catalogues and promised to wait for cargo before signing. Waiting could mean finishing required work, Chen said. The branch keeper called: the main box had bypassed school for a rail supply shelter, described as textbook rerouting. We left under streetlights. Cheng divided the chocolate three ways. Next we would align acceptance with actual receiving times and prevent a deleted 'await' sending goods farther."]});
